    id: 'debezium',
    title: 'Debezium',
    content: `Debezium là open-source CDC platform được build trên Apache Kafka Connect.

**Supported Databases:**
- MySQL (via binlog)
- PostgreSQL (via WAL)
- MongoDB
- SQL Server
- Oracle
- Db2

**Architecture:**
\`\`\`
MySQL → Debezium Connector → Kafka Topic → Sink Connector → Lakehouse
\`\`\`

**Key Features:**
- Transaction order guarantee
- Schema evolution support
- Exactly-once processing`,
  },
  {
    id: 'lakehouse',
    title: 'Lakehouse Architecture',
    content: `Lakehouse pattern tổ chức data theo layers:

**Bronze Layer (Raw)**
- Lưu trữ raw CDC data
- Schema unchanged từ source
- Full history retention
- Parquet format với columnar storage

**Silver Layer (Cleaned)**
- Deduplicated records
- Type casting & validation
- NULL handling
- Business logic applied

**Gold Layer (Business)**
- Pre-aggregated metrics
- Dimension tables denormalized
- ML training datasets
- BI dashboards ready

**Tools:**
- Apache Spark, Flink cho processing
- Delta Lake, Iceberg cho storage
- Grafana, Superset cho visualization`,
